&lt;h6&gt;（１株当たり情報）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 608.00000000000000000000000001px; margin-left: auto"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
